## What happens at each limit (depth 5, request A)

- max_facts = facts - 1: denied: Reached Datalog execution limits
- max_facts = facts: denied: Reached Datalog execution limits
- max_iterations = 1: denied: Reached Datalog execution limits
- max_time = 1 µs: denied: Reached Datalog execution limits
- defaults (1000 facts, 100 iterations, 1 ms): allowed

